  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Enable seamless communication between Liferay and Camunda",
    "splashDescription": "The Liferay connector enables you to use Liferay data in Camunda-powered processes, leveraging entities such as Objects, Users, Accounts, Organizations, Roles, Picklists, and Templates. Use this connector to automate business processes that involve Liferay’s user management, content, and permissions. Reduce manual interventions by allowing event-driven workflows.",
